# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-revol03-0 = 
    你坐下，与$NamedOneName一同分析当前局势。你们讨论了……<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>各派当前态度。<br><p><opt>...<indent>张贴传单之处。<br><p><opt>...<indent>如何影响一个派系。<br><p><opt>...<indent>如何发现并运用秘闻。<br><p><opt>...<indent>对敌方总部突袭的价值。<br><p><opt>...<indent>向$councilHall进军，以取代政府。<br><opt>...<indent>向$fortress进军，以取代政府。<br><opt>...<indent>因叛国罪逮捕叛乱者。<br><opt>8<br><p><opt>...<indent>真正开始工作。你离去。
msg-revol03-1 = 
    首先，你与有影响力的商人和银行家商讨他们对市政府变革的态度。<br><p>
    当地商户$Support1更替。<br><if-1>he Hansards $Support2 the overthrow of the government.<endif><if-2>he Fugger bankers $Support3 change.<endif><if-3>he Medici representatives $Support4 the rebels.<endif><br>
    外国商人$Support5更替。<br><br>
msg-revol03-2 = 
    接下来，你考量教士与民众之态度。<br><p>
    总而言之，你认为$PlaceName $Support1的市民支持市政府变革。<br><if-1>$monastery的院长及僧侣$Support2变革。<endif><br>
    $cityChurch的教士$Support3政府中的变动。<br><if-2>$cathedral的主教及其追随者$Support4变革。<endif>
msg-revol03-3 = 
    终，汝与工匠商议其对市政变革之态度。<br><if-1>he blacksmiths $Support change.<endif><br><if-2>he swordsmiths $Support1 change.<endif><if-3>he armorers $Support2 change.<endif><if-4>he bowyers and gunsmiths $Support3 changes.<endif><if-5>he artisans and tinkers $Support4 change.<endif><if-6>he jewellers $Support5 change.<endif><if-7>he clothmakers $Support6 changes.<endif><br>
msg-revol03-4 = 
    你得知，影响人心的最佳方式莫过于与之交谈！有时，友善的对话便能令人信服。然而，你须谨记，多数人终将决意支持一方。一旦心意已定，几乎再难使其回心转意。<br>
msg-revol03-5 = 
    Now that you have accepted their pay and received a pile of handbills, you are unavoidably obliged to post them. This isn't hard: you'll do it as you move about the city. <br><p>
    然而，如今你或将与对方雇佣的打手发生冲突。既已与某方势力相系，唯有暂离$PlaceName，待时局纷乱尘埃落定、胜负分明，方可免此险厄。
msg-revol03-6 = 
    倒也不妨看看反对派中谁藏有不堪的秘密。有时仅凭声称知晓便已足够，有时则需确凿证据。<br><p>
    果然，有时他们连你的证据也置若罔闻。如此，揭露其耻辱或能促其更替。可惜，新主之见难测。<br><br>
msg-revol03-7 = 
    当然，反对派必定有一个作为总部的住所或办公室。一次极具破坏力的突袭会让他们显得软弱无能，连自身都无法保护，更遑论他们的支持者。
msg-revol03-8 = 
    Overall, the balance of opinion aligned with your side greatly outweighs that aligned with the opposition. Therefore, <if-1>now is a good time to march on the $councilHall. <endif>如今正是进军$fortress之时。<endif>如今正是逮捕叛逆首恶之时。<endif>
msg-revol03-9 = 
    盛传数日内，叛军将集结兵力，进逼城池。<if-1>$councilHall, the city hall<endif> $fortress, the city's fortress<endif> Some people worry about the rebels inviting mercenaries or adventurers to help fight in their cause.
msg-revol03-10 = 
    盛传数日内，城卫将奉命逮捕所有叛首，以叛国罪论处。
